 business, transport, travel, financial and other services)."},{"question":"How should I read it?","answer":"Look at year-on-year growth in the second view; monthly values are lumpy, with quarter-end months often larger.^Services exports have been the main offset to the goods trade deficit."},{"question":"Revisions and caveats","answer":"The most recent months are provisional and later re-based to the quarterly balance of payments. Values on this page for months published long ago are the figures from the RBI release that last showed them.^The Commerce Ministry's own figure for the latest services month (in its press release) is a projection, not RBI data, and is not used here."}],"related":[],"layer":"added","note":"The latest two months are provisional; RBI revises them pro rata when each quarter's balance of payments is published. Earlier months here are as first published in the RBI releases (provisional, or revised where a later release showed them), so old months may differ from the final BoP figures.","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T07:29:06+00:00"}